他本爲之註，始以考異及所註者散入通鑑各文之下；曆法、天文則隨目錄所書而附註焉。汔乙酉冬，乃克徹編。凡紀事之本末，地名之同異，州縣之建置離合，制度之沿革損益，悉疏其所以然。若釋文之舛謬，悉改而正之，著辯誤十二卷。","t":"","tokens":[{"text":"乙巳，先君卒，盡瘁家蠱，又從事科舉業，史學不敢廢也。寶祐丙辰，出身進士科，始得大肆其力於是書。游宦遠外，率攜以自隨；有異書異人，必就而正焉。依","note":false,"kind":"text"},{"text":"陸德明","note":false,"kind":"name","personMention":203,"personId":null},{"text":"經典釋文","note":false,"kind":"book"},{"text":"，釐爲","note":false,"kind":"text"},{"text":"廣註","note":false,"kind":"book"},{"text":"九十七卷；著","note":false,"kind":"text"},{"text":"論","note":false,"kind":"book"},{"text":"十篇，自","note":false,"kind":"text"},{"text":"周","note":false,"kind":"place"},{"text":"訖","note":false,"kind":"text"},{"text":"五代","note":false,"kind":"place"},{"text":"，略敍興亡大致。咸淳庚午，從","note":false,"kind":"text"},{"text":"淮","note":false,"kind":"place"},{"text":"壖歸","note":false,"kind":"text"},{"text":"杭","note":false,"kind":"place"},{"text":"都，","note":false,"kind":"text"},{"text":"延平廖公","note":false,"kind":"name","personMention":204,"personId":null},{"text":"見而韙之，禮致諸家，俾讎校","note":false,"kind":"text"},{"text":"通鑑","note":false,"kind":"book"},{"text":"以授其子弟，爲著","note":false,"kind":"text"},{"text":"讎校通鑑凡例","note":false,"kind":"book"},{"text":"。","note":false,"kind":"text"},{"text":"廖","note":false,"kind":"name","personMention":205,"personId":null},{"text":"轉薦之","note":false,"kind":"text"},{"text":"賈相國","note":false,"kind":"name","personMention":206,"personId":null},{"text":"，德祐乙亥，從軍","note":false,"kind":"text"},{"text":"江","note":false,"kind":"place"},{"text":"上，言輒不用，旣而軍潰，間道歸鄕里。丙子，","note":false,"kind":"text"},{"text":"浙東","note":false,"kind":"place"},{"text":"始騷，辟地越之","note":false,"kind":"text"},{"text":"新昌","note":false,"kind":"place"},{"text":"；師從之，以孥免，失其書。亂定反室，復購得他本爲之註，始以","note":false,"kind":"text"},{"text":"考異","note":false,"kind":"book"},{"text":"及所註者散入","note":false,"kind":"text"},{"text":"通鑑","note":false,"kind":"book"},{"text":"各文之下；曆法、天文則隨","note":false,"kind":"text"},{"text":"目錄","note":false,"kind":"book"},{"text":"所書而附註焉。汔乙酉冬，乃克徹編。凡紀事